      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/Access/CommunicationAccessFilter.cs + ICommunicationAccessFilter.cs (REUSE — 2-rule privacy + internal-only filter)</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/CommunicationThreadReadModels.cs (REUSE — R1 read DTO shape)</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/Engine/RegardingFieldMap.cs (REUSE — 11-entity → typed-lookup map; entity-set-agnostic resolution)</file>
      <file>docs/standards/DATA-ACCESS-DECISION-CRITERIA.md (BFF read for the timeline vs Xrm.WebApi)</file>
      <file>../messaging-communication-app-r1/notes/access-model-decision.md (membership-union retired 2026-07-16 — binding)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-01">Scope: the `by-regarding` endpoint returns ALL threads + messages for a regarding record, entity-set-agnostic across all 11 families; returns the SAME DTO shape as the R1 thread-id read (reuse `CommunicationThreadReadModels`); applies the impersonation + 2-rule filter.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-03">Scope: this read surface MUST apply R1's impersonation + 2-rule (privacy + internal-only) filter via `IImpersonatedCommunicationQuery` + `CommunicationAccessFilter`; no message content may bypass the BFF access filter. MUST NOT reintroduce membership-union on reads (retired 2026-07-16). Do NOT author a second/divergent filter.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Scope: the impersonation read path is the blessed mechanism — extend `CommunicationThreadReadService` / `IImpersonatedCommunicationQuery`; MUST NOT fork it, MUST NOT `new` a credential; inject the central `TokenCredential` + canonical Dataverse interfaces.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-008">Scope: the new route carries the standard communication authorization endpoint filter; auth posture consistent with the existing `/api/communications` group.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-019">Scope: errors on this route (regarding record not found, forbidden, bad `entityType`) return RFC 7807 ProblemDetails.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">Scope: regarding resolution uses the existing 11-entity family via `RegardingFieldMap.All`; MUST NOT add a second regarding mechanism.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-032 / ADR-010">Scope: the route is registered unconditionally on the existing group; any feature-gated dependency uses the Null-Object pattern (no asymmetric registration); interfaces are test seams over concretes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project §10">Scope: BFF Hygiene — load `.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md` before designing; state the Placement Justification in the PR (extends the existing `CommunicationEndpoints` group + read service — no new group/mechanism); report publish-size delta vs ~46.99 MB baseline (expected ≈0, no new packages); no new HIGH CVE; update tests in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project §11">Scope: Component Justification — the route is new only because REST needs a new path; state the concrete FR-01/NFR-03 failure modes prevented (Surface 1 has no data source; private/internal-only leak) with grep evidence that no existing route returns a regarding record's threads.</constraint>
  </constraints>

