      <pattern name="Impersonation + 2-rule read" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/">
        Route the read through `IImpersonatedCommunicationQuery.QueryAsync` (impersonated Dataverse retrieve) then compose privacy + internal-only via `CommunicationAccessFilter` — the endpoint NEVER re-derives access and NEVER unions membership.
      </pattern>
